                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "I would prefer for that to be done in a separate patch.\n\nTo better separate rework from feature/capability add."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/topology.cpp",
                    "line": 7,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "After discussion with @christopher.meis@9elements.com, \nwe can add other items like Cpu and Dimm in a separate patch, resolving this comment."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/topology.cpp",
