                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Christopher Meis",
                        "email": "christopher.meis@9elements.com",
                        "username": "ChriMarMe"
                    },
                    "message": "In the association.md changed in: https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/82817/9, you mention cooling/cooled_by. Where is that type of association?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/topology.cpp",
                    "line": 23,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Shoot, thanks for noticing.\n\nIf the topology rework merges then \nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/82408 can rebase and implement the `cooling`/`cooled_by`.\n\n@christopher.sides@hpe.com had some docs and extra context/commit message for his change so it might be good to have his change merge instead of doing it here without the context.\n\nI fixed the docs change in 82817 to not say anything about `cooling`/`cooled_by`."
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/topology.hpp",
                    "line": 24,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Marvin Drees",
                        "username": "MDr164"
                    },
                    "message": "NIT: This reads like a question. Maybe more like \"The type (e.g. Chassis, Board, Valve, ...) on which the association is allowed\""
                },
                {
                    "file": "src/entity_manager/topology.hpp",
